WEBVTT

00:18.220 --> 00:19.660
Hey, Blade!

00:20.170 --> 00:21.870
The least you could do is draw your sword!

00:22.160 --> 00:25.630
Don't disrespect your opponents 
by looking away during a fight!

00:28.340 --> 00:31.380
You look a little different.

00:32.070 --> 00:33.680
D-Do I?

00:33.680 --> 00:35.050
In what way?

00:42.650 --> 00:43.560
Oh!

00:43.880 --> 00:45.290
Ah!

00:45.860 --> 00:46.810
No idea!

00:50.070 --> 00:52.950
Take notice when a lady 
changes up her hairstyle!

00:52.950 --> 00:54.820
Huh? Oh, was that it?

00:55.390 --> 00:59.480
It's not like I wanted you to notice...

00:59.950 --> 01:01.530
Oh yeah, Blade.

01:01.530 --> 01:04.210
If you've got time to horse around 
with the likes of Leonard,

01:04.210 --> 01:05.660
can you also keep an eye on that girl?

01:05.660 --> 01:07.350
The likes of me?!

01:07.350 --> 01:08.330
That girl?

01:10.480 --> 01:12.340
Ah, you mean Sophie?

01:12.640 --> 01:15.050
The likes of...?! How heartless!

01:15.050 --> 01:16.030
Why's she by herself?

01:16.030 --> 01:17.040
Ignored!

01:17.570 --> 01:19.900
That's how she always is.

01:19.900 --> 01:22.060
Even though she obeys any 
commands she's given.

01:22.290 --> 01:23.720
Is that so?

01:23.720 --> 01:24.510
Yeah.

01:24.510 --> 01:27.560
But I've never seen her take 
any spontaneous action.

01:28.020 --> 01:31.570
And yet, she voluntarily told you her name.

01:31.880 --> 01:34.440
That's why I'm leaving her to you, Blade.

01:34.440 --> 01:35.380
Got it.

01:36.730 --> 01:38.880
You need to build up more stamina!

01:38.880 --> 01:42.330
Run ten kilometers every morning 
for the rest of your life!

01:43.960 --> 01:45.460
My whole life?

01:46.480 --> 01:48.210
Yo! I'm Blade!

01:48.910 --> 01:50.290
I know.

01:50.290 --> 01:54.010
Earnest asked me to watch over your training!

01:54.010 --> 01:55.710
Is that a command?

01:55.710 --> 01:58.640
Well, that's not what I meant.

01:58.640 --> 02:01.940
I guess it's true that she asked me...

02:05.900 --> 02:07.980
I'm here because I want to help you.

02:09.930 --> 02:13.730
But... this is all I can use.

02:14.170 --> 02:15.990
Why barehanded?

02:15.990 --> 02:18.150
This is all I was taught.

02:18.150 --> 02:20.240
In that case, I'll teach 
you other ways to fight.

02:20.640 --> 02:22.490
Is that a command?

02:22.490 --> 02:23.680
Nope.

02:24.110 --> 02:26.000
I want to lend you a hand as your friend!

02:27.040 --> 02:29.660
It's not a command,
so I won't force you into it.

02:31.850 --> 02:32.860
Are you against the idea?

02:36.440 --> 02:38.260
No, I'm not.

02:40.230 --> 02:41.810
It's settled, then!

02:41.810 --> 02:43.390
Okay, first off...

02:43.710 --> 02:47.390
All right, that's it for 
today's practical training!

02:47.390 --> 02:49.060
Huh?! Why?!

02:49.060 --> 02:50.460
We were just getting started!

02:50.460 --> 02:52.590
It's because you took your sweet time!

02:52.590 --> 02:54.270
No way...

04:33.210 --> 04:36.000
<b>Episode 2</b>

04:34.040 --> 04:36.000
<b>Sophie</b>

04:39.580 --> 04:40.670
I can't cut through it.

04:41.100 --> 04:43.000
Channel your fighting spirit into the sword.

04:43.000 --> 04:45.920
You have no problem channeling 
it into your fists, right?

04:46.890 --> 04:50.560
Then think of the sword as 
an extension of your body.

04:52.850 --> 04:54.020
Like this.

04:55.560 --> 04:56.760
Understood.

05:06.640 --> 05:08.050
I managed to cut them.

05:08.050 --> 05:09.920
You sure learn fast!

05:09.920 --> 05:12.410
If you can handle a sword like this,
I think you're set.

05:13.560 --> 05:15.310
Let's call it a day.

05:15.960 --> 05:17.540
Can I beat her now?

05:17.880 --> 05:18.540
Eh?

05:19.710 --> 05:20.540
Who do you mean?

05:20.540 --> 05:21.670
Earnest.

05:22.180 --> 05:23.360
Well...

05:23.360 --> 05:25.190
I don't know about that.

05:25.190 --> 05:27.760
Getting to her level won't be so easy...

05:28.210 --> 05:29.020
I see.

05:31.520 --> 05:32.180
Huh?

05:36.260 --> 05:37.050
Huh?

05:38.530 --> 05:40.560
This is stronger.

05:41.630 --> 05:42.570
Guess you're right.

05:43.760 --> 05:46.320
By the way, I can't move.

05:46.880 --> 05:51.710
It wouldn't be a good mount position 
if the opponent could move freely.

05:52.550 --> 05:53.330
Good point.

05:54.650 --> 05:58.390
I want you to teach me 
something else tomorrow.

05:58.390 --> 05:59.920
Yeah, sure thing!

06:01.860 --> 06:04.600
How's your school life going?

06:05.510 --> 06:06.720
I made some friends.

06:07.190 --> 06:09.200
I'm glad to hear that.

06:09.200 --> 06:12.470
You've been active as a hero 
since you were three years old.

06:12.470 --> 06:16.520
Even I have someone I consider my best friend,
while you, on the other hand...

06:16.520 --> 06:18.070
Well, sorry!

06:18.840 --> 06:20.780
I really am so glad.

06:22.020 --> 06:25.570
So, who exactly is it you call your friend?

06:26.070 --> 06:28.260
There's more than one...

06:28.260 --> 06:30.790
But recently, I guess... Sophie.

06:30.790 --> 06:31.820
Oh...

06:32.730 --> 06:36.370
I should have known you'd 
take an interest in her.

06:37.280 --> 06:39.390
She's a strong one, wouldn't you say?

06:39.390 --> 06:41.330
Yeah, she's strong.

06:42.730 --> 06:45.590
Even so, she's still incomplete.

06:45.590 --> 06:46.380
What?

06:46.380 --> 06:51.090
After all, the goal was for her 
completed form to surpass you.

06:51.420 --> 06:52.720
What are you talking about?!

06:53.730 --> 06:57.290
You didn't befriend her because you knew?

06:57.290 --> 07:00.230
About the Artificial Great Hero Project?

07:00.690 --> 07:02.970
Artificial Great Hero?

07:03.870 --> 07:06.620
If you, the Great Hero, can exist,

07:06.620 --> 07:09.160
it should also be possible to 
create a being just like you.

07:09.160 --> 07:12.450
That was the idea proposed 
by a certain group.

07:12.880 --> 07:15.370
With ancient forbidden 
knowledge that had been lost,

07:15.370 --> 07:17.770
they took a human who showed 
aptitude as a template,

07:17.770 --> 07:21.710
and tried to artificially manifest 
the Great Hero's powers.

07:22.080 --> 07:25.200
What's more, they duplicated 
that original human

07:25.200 --> 07:29.410
in order to perform countless 
experiments and adjustments.

07:29.410 --> 07:30.410
Hold on...

07:30.410 --> 07:31.690
Hold on just one minute!

07:31.690 --> 07:32.900
Duplicated?

07:32.900 --> 07:34.720
I thought we were talking about Sophie!

07:35.010 --> 07:39.090
Her real name is Sophitia Femto.

07:39.090 --> 07:41.490
Femto meaning "twelve."

07:41.490 --> 07:46.860
That is to say, she's the twelfth iteration 
of the human named Sophitia.

07:47.470 --> 07:51.950
As an experimental subject, she was 
treated for so long as simply an object.

07:53.410 --> 07:55.450
Hey, don't tell me that those experiments...

07:56.480 --> 07:58.400
No need for concern!

07:58.400 --> 08:00.950
I've completely put an 
end to that organization.

08:03.290 --> 08:05.710
If it wasn't your doing, 
you should have said so.

08:05.970 --> 08:10.870
When I took her in, I told 
her that she was free now.

08:10.870 --> 08:12.220
She responded with...

08:12.960 --> 08:15.090
Is that a command?

08:16.300 --> 08:19.630
I expect that hasn't changed.

08:24.590 --> 08:29.650
Sophie was robbed of a normal life 
for the sake of creating a Great Hero.

08:32.210 --> 08:33.530
It's my fault.

08:34.470 --> 08:37.120
It's all because I exist.

08:37.120 --> 08:37.780
In that case...

08:38.160 --> 08:41.490
I'll make sure Sophie gets 
her normal life back!

08:42.280 --> 08:43.290
But...

08:43.980 --> 08:45.730
What <i>is</i> normal, anyway?

08:47.760 --> 08:49.510
Oh, what's wrong?

08:49.510 --> 08:52.030
You're not scheduled for 
your check-up just yet.

08:52.030 --> 08:54.630
Did you want me to look you over?

08:54.630 --> 08:56.260
In that case, take off your clothes.

08:56.260 --> 08:57.390
Take them off right now.

08:57.390 --> 08:58.580
Please tell me!

08:58.580 --> 09:00.100
What does being normal mean?

09:00.100 --> 09:03.140
What kinds of things do 
kids my age normally do?!

09:03.840 --> 09:06.950
So you're finally interested 
in exploring that subject.

09:06.950 --> 09:08.140
I don't mind.

09:08.140 --> 09:12.030
I'll teach you <i>everything</i> there is 
to know about the vigor of youth—

09:12.030 --> 09:13.070
Got it!

09:13.890 --> 09:15.310
So it's youth!

09:16.670 --> 09:18.030
What is it, Blade?

09:18.030 --> 09:20.740
Youth! What does youth mean?

09:20.740 --> 09:22.060
What does it involve?!

09:22.060 --> 09:24.290
I'm not sure where this came from...

09:24.290 --> 09:26.160
But when you think of youth,
it'd have to be...

09:26.740 --> 09:27.250
Love, perhaps?

09:27.250 --> 09:28.180
Got it!

09:28.180 --> 09:29.040
So it's love!

09:29.040 --> 09:29.970
Go!

09:29.970 --> 09:30.990
Blade?

09:30.990 --> 09:31.920
What's the matter?

09:31.920 --> 09:33.240
Please tell me!

09:33.240 --> 09:34.430
What is love?

09:34.430 --> 09:35.930
What do you do when you're in love?!

09:35.930 --> 09:37.180
What? Love?!

09:37.600 --> 09:38.940
W-Well...

09:38.940 --> 09:40.380
Go on! Out with it!

09:40.800 --> 09:43.560
Things like... going on dates together—

09:43.560 --> 09:44.460
Got it!

09:44.460 --> 09:45.890
So it's dates!

09:46.400 --> 09:49.060
Why'd you suddenly come up to my room?

09:49.060 --> 09:50.190
Earnest!

09:50.190 --> 09:51.530
What's a date?

09:51.530 --> 09:52.850
What exactly do you do?!

09:52.850 --> 09:53.780
A date?!

09:53.780 --> 09:55.570
H-H-Hold on a moment, Blade!

09:55.570 --> 09:56.960
Please tell me!

09:56.960 --> 09:58.510
I'm begging you, Earnest!

09:58.510 --> 09:59.160
Eh?!

09:59.160 --> 10:00.570
That's, well...

10:01.090 --> 10:05.330
Couples spend time alone talking, 
walk around town, go shopping...

10:05.810 --> 10:09.670
B-But we're not at that level yet...

10:09.670 --> 10:12.840
I think it's still a little 
too early for a date...

10:12.840 --> 10:13.520
Got it!

10:13.520 --> 10:14.790
I'm off on a date!

10:15.590 --> 10:17.460
Huh? Wait...

10:18.340 --> 10:19.950
With who exactly?!

10:19.950 --> 10:20.920
Step step step.

10:20.920 --> 10:22.200
Where's Sophie?!

10:22.200 --> 10:24.160
Sophie's still inside—

10:24.160 --> 10:24.800
Thanks!

10:24.800 --> 10:25.830
Huh?! Wait!

10:25.830 --> 10:26.430
Sophie!

10:26.760 --> 10:27.430
Sophie!

10:27.780 --> 10:28.940
Sophie!

10:29.200 --> 10:29.690
What?!

10:30.000 --> 10:31.190
Blade?!

10:32.260 --> 10:33.210
Sophie!

10:34.370 --> 10:35.440
Let's go on a date!

10:36.450 --> 10:38.150
Is that a command?

10:38.150 --> 10:39.310
No, it's not.

10:39.310 --> 10:41.950
But it's very important!

10:44.640 --> 10:45.950
I understand.

10:48.440 --> 10:50.960
Yes, officer, this man right here.

10:55.760 --> 10:58.560
Blade barged into the girls' shower...

10:58.560 --> 11:00.490
A lot of girls have filed complaints.

11:00.490 --> 11:02.850
What in the world's gotten into that idiot?

11:02.850 --> 11:04.220
I'll have to sternly steer 
him down the right path.

11:04.900 --> 11:06.060
Red bean bun!

11:06.060 --> 11:06.970
Huh?

11:07.260 --> 11:08.200
Here, Claire.

11:08.200 --> 11:09.630
Please take one too, Empress.

11:09.630 --> 11:10.520
Thank you.

11:10.520 --> 11:11.480
Bread?

11:12.500 --> 11:14.120
What is this? It's so sweet!

11:14.120 --> 11:15.890
It <i>is</i> a red bean bun.

11:15.890 --> 11:17.920
Have you never had one before?

11:17.920 --> 11:19.400
O-O-Of course I have!

11:19.990 --> 11:22.490
So sweet!

11:22.740 --> 11:25.470
So even the Empress makes faces like that.

11:26.010 --> 11:27.810
H-Hey, you two...

11:27.810 --> 11:30.580
Can you stop it with the whole Empress thing?

11:30.580 --> 11:31.960
Lady Earnest, then?

11:31.960 --> 11:33.250
Not that, either!

11:33.250 --> 11:34.630
Just call me Earnest.

11:34.630 --> 11:37.000
O-Oh, no! We couldn't possibly!

11:37.860 --> 11:41.550
Right now, we're comrades 
united by our mission,

11:41.550 --> 11:45.080
to watch Blade so he doesn't 
try any funny business.

11:45.080 --> 11:46.350
You could...

11:46.800 --> 11:49.540
p-practically say that we're friends!

11:49.540 --> 11:50.290
Yep.

11:50.290 --> 11:51.640
You're right.

11:51.880 --> 11:54.060
Ah, it's almost time.

11:54.310 --> 11:56.560
Oh, you're right on time.

11:56.560 --> 11:58.990
Is that not normal?

11:58.990 --> 12:01.530
I don't know anything about dates.

12:01.880 --> 12:02.890
That's fine.

12:02.890 --> 12:04.690
Leave everything to me!

12:04.690 --> 12:07.030
I did loads of studying for this!

12:07.030 --> 12:10.000
Okay, let's review our agenda for today.

12:10.000 --> 12:11.310
Assemble at 1000 hours.

12:11.310 --> 12:13.080
Salute and briefing at 1001 hours.

12:13.080 --> 12:14.220
Begin mobilizing at 1003 hours.

12:14.220 --> 12:15.430
Patrol town until 1030 hours.

12:15.430 --> 12:17.480
Afterwards, R&R at a parlor until 1100 hours.

12:17.480 --> 12:18.610
Lunch time starting at 1200 hours.

12:18.610 --> 12:20.550
Further agenda items to follow at lunch time!

12:20.550 --> 12:22.070
Isn't that a little too precise?

12:22.070 --> 12:23.840
This sounds less like a date...

12:23.840 --> 12:25.800
And more like a spec ops mission!

12:26.140 --> 12:27.970
It's already 1004 hours.

12:27.970 --> 12:29.710
Oh, no! What do we do?!

12:29.710 --> 12:31.310
The agenda! The agenda!

12:32.890 --> 12:35.550
We just need to begin mobilizing now.

12:35.550 --> 12:37.060
Ah, that's right!

12:39.400 --> 12:41.920
W-Walking arm in arm? How indecent!

12:41.920 --> 12:43.470
That's totally normal.

12:43.470 --> 12:44.580
Calm down, Anna.

12:44.580 --> 12:45.790
Anna?

12:45.790 --> 12:48.050
It's a nickname, since we're friends.

12:48.050 --> 12:49.750
Should I call you something else?

12:50.880 --> 12:53.180
I'm fine with Anna!

12:53.180 --> 12:53.870
Ah!

12:55.440 --> 12:57.050
I lost sight of them.

12:57.910 --> 12:59.200
Heave-ho.

13:10.010 --> 13:11.040
Look, look!

13:11.040 --> 13:11.730
Oh, wow.

13:11.730 --> 13:12.720
They're eating it!

13:12.720 --> 13:14.270
I want to try feeding them.

13:14.720 --> 13:16.350
Okay! Just you wait!

13:19.820 --> 13:20.960
Let's dump it in.

13:20.960 --> 13:21.480
There!

13:23.650 --> 13:26.240
Too much! There's too much!

13:26.240 --> 13:29.370
What's with the date-like activities?!

13:29.820 --> 13:31.480
They <i>are</i> on a date.

13:33.090 --> 13:35.070
There they go.

13:35.980 --> 13:37.500
Heave-ho.

13:38.000 --> 13:39.490
I just need to punch this?

13:39.490 --> 13:41.600
Okay, on the count of two.

13:41.600 --> 13:42.250
Are you ready?

13:42.720 --> 13:44.230
I-I'll have you know...

13:44.230 --> 13:46.240
I'm perfectly capable of this much!

13:46.240 --> 13:47.520
Th-That aside...

13:47.520 --> 13:49.140
W-We need to stop them!

13:48.130 --> 13:49.140
One, two!

13:52.470 --> 13:54.100
Aw, man, they've done it now.

13:54.100 --> 13:55.600
We're so sorry! We're so sorry!

13:55.600 --> 13:57.540
You can send the bill to Rosewood Academy...

13:57.540 --> 13:58.350
Heave-ho.

13:58.350 --> 14:03.400
Our next mission is to finish this
Lovely Infinite Tropical Drink together!

14:04.080 --> 14:05.690
I just need to drink this?

14:05.690 --> 14:06.540
Wait!

14:06.540 --> 14:08.140
It's only 1029 hours!

14:08.140 --> 14:09.160
We've still got one minute!

14:09.670 --> 14:11.210
I'm thirsty.

14:11.210 --> 14:13.050
Well... that's fine, then.

14:15.990 --> 14:17.280
It's hard to sip this.

14:17.280 --> 14:18.860
Come a little closer.

14:18.860 --> 14:19.920
S-Sure.

14:22.640 --> 14:23.420
What's wrong?

14:23.720 --> 14:25.900
Well, I'm not sure...

14:25.900 --> 14:27.270
But it feels...

14:27.270 --> 14:28.170
Feels...

14:28.560 --> 14:32.120
I can't complete this mission by myself.

14:32.120 --> 14:33.680
I need your help.

14:33.680 --> 14:35.850
I-I know.

14:35.850 --> 14:36.680
I know that!

14:37.550 --> 14:39.500
<i>Be still, my beating heart!</i>

14:42.570 --> 14:43.800
Come a little closer.

14:43.800 --> 14:45.190
<i>My heart... My heart...</i>

14:45.830 --> 14:47.650
They haven't noticed us at all.

14:47.650 --> 14:49.280
I think I've gotten sick of this.

14:49.280 --> 14:52.290
How obscene! Dirty! Impure!

14:52.290 --> 14:53.110
Filthy animals!

14:53.110 --> 14:54.760
Their cheeks are touching!

14:54.760 --> 14:55.620
Here, Anna.

14:55.620 --> 14:56.700
You can have this.

14:57.780 --> 15:00.120
Cheeks cheekily chafing...

15:00.850 --> 15:02.390
So cool and sweet!

15:02.390 --> 15:04.000
What is this yummy treat?!

15:04.000 --> 15:05.860
It's called a parfait.

15:05.860 --> 15:07.610
Yum yum!

15:07.610 --> 15:09.520
So are you done now?

15:09.520 --> 15:10.420
With what?

15:10.420 --> 15:12.540
They've already left.

15:16.100 --> 15:17.150
Heave-ho.

15:18.020 --> 15:19.280
What's wrong?

15:19.280 --> 15:23.520
Well, it felt like we were being followed...

15:24.160 --> 15:25.090
Oh well.

15:25.090 --> 15:27.030
Blade, you moron!

15:27.500 --> 15:29.730
Anyway, next on the agenda...

15:29.730 --> 15:32.290
Oh, no! Look at the time!

15:34.140 --> 15:35.530
It's fine.

15:35.780 --> 15:37.370
We can take a shortcut.

15:59.230 --> 16:01.680
Is this our final target?

16:01.680 --> 16:04.400
I heard this is a legendary fountain.

16:05.330 --> 16:06.830
I don't really understand.

16:06.830 --> 16:08.400
Me, neither.

16:11.040 --> 16:12.900
I had fun today.

16:13.300 --> 16:14.660
Well...

16:17.630 --> 16:19.910
Can I ask one thing?

16:20.870 --> 16:21.910
What is it?

16:23.180 --> 16:25.380
Why are you going to all this trouble?

16:25.380 --> 16:27.320
Why, you ask...

16:28.090 --> 16:29.760
That's because...

16:29.760 --> 16:32.420
you're my friend.

16:35.690 --> 16:38.180
You and I are friends?

16:38.180 --> 16:39.570
That's right!

16:39.570 --> 16:40.430
You bet we are!

16:41.780 --> 16:46.940
I heard friends don't keep 
secrets from each other.

16:48.370 --> 16:50.310
Well, I...

16:50.730 --> 16:54.370
There's something I haven't told you.

16:54.370 --> 16:54.950
Huh?

16:56.300 --> 16:59.360
If you and I are friends...

16:59.360 --> 17:03.600
If you're willing to be my friend...

17:04.190 --> 17:06.460
there's something I need to tell you.

17:07.680 --> 17:10.710
I'm not an ordinary human.

17:11.870 --> 17:16.700
An incomplete test subject, 
created to be an artificial hero.

17:17.920 --> 17:22.220
I was granted what are known as 
Artificial Great Hero Powers.

17:23.470 --> 17:25.850
Artificial... Great Hero Powers?

17:26.310 --> 17:26.850
Look.

17:33.460 --> 17:37.360
Great Hero Powers can 
alter the laws of physics.

17:37.990 --> 17:38.840
However...

17:43.490 --> 17:45.270
I have incomplete control of them.

17:48.660 --> 17:50.130
Gravity manipulation...

17:50.830 --> 17:54.790
I magnified my body weight by 1,000 
times... or that was my intent.

17:54.790 --> 17:56.380
This is actually around 10,000 times.

17:56.880 --> 17:57.510
Sophie.

18:02.330 --> 18:04.850
I can even stop time itself.

18:12.000 --> 18:14.050
As I am now...

18:14.050 --> 18:18.150
I can manifest Artificial Great 
Hero Powers for just ten seconds.

18:19.680 --> 18:21.370
Sophitia Femto.

18:22.800 --> 18:27.040
The twelfth clone of a woman named Sophitia.

18:27.040 --> 18:28.290
That is what I am.

18:28.820 --> 18:32.600
The final model of the 
Artificial Great Hero Project,

18:32.600 --> 18:35.510
and its sole success, with caveats.

18:38.450 --> 18:41.490
In that case, I won't 
keep any secrets, either.

18:41.490 --> 18:42.260
Please listen.

18:43.360 --> 18:44.510
I'm listening.

18:45.280 --> 18:46.020
I'm...

18:47.520 --> 18:48.140
They call me...

18:50.080 --> 18:53.430
They call me... the Great Hero!

18:58.710 --> 19:01.440
No, they <i>used</i> to call me that.

19:01.990 --> 19:04.720
Those powers are gone now.

19:04.720 --> 19:05.820
I see.

19:06.420 --> 19:08.750
Could it be that you realized?

19:08.750 --> 19:09.890
No.

19:09.890 --> 19:13.540
But something about you felt familiar.

19:14.510 --> 19:16.100
I'm really sorry.

19:17.320 --> 19:19.800
It's not something that an apology 
and forgiveness can fix...

19:20.620 --> 19:22.300
Feel free to resent me.

19:23.270 --> 19:25.050
Why would I do that?

19:25.050 --> 19:30.270
Because the reason you were born 
with such accursed powers...

19:30.890 --> 19:31.770
Accursed?

19:32.200 --> 19:33.330
That's right!

19:33.330 --> 19:35.580
This power is a curse!

19:35.580 --> 19:37.780
I never...

19:38.540 --> 19:41.030
The Great Hero wasn't 
something I asked to be!

19:43.240 --> 19:47.040
But because they said I could save everyone,

19:47.040 --> 19:49.240
that's why there was no choice but to do it!

19:49.790 --> 19:52.480
With powers that manifested 
at the age of three...

19:52.480 --> 19:55.880
Fighting monsters,
fighting them again and again...

19:56.530 --> 19:59.380
Lingering between life and 
death countless times...

19:59.710 --> 20:01.130
And growing strong.

20:01.740 --> 20:05.590
Even so, not every single 
person can be rescued.

20:05.590 --> 20:07.510
There are those who couldn't be saved!

20:07.920 --> 20:10.690
People get so angry when 
you can't save someone!

20:10.690 --> 20:12.020
Why didn't you save them?

20:12.140 --> 20:13.410
Why?!

20:13.410 --> 20:14.900
Aren't you the Great Hero?!

20:17.820 --> 20:20.380
It's... It's...

20:25.190 --> 20:26.570
The Great Hero...

20:27.680 --> 20:29.740
What does it mean to be the Great Hero?

20:37.860 --> 20:38.940
Blade.

20:40.080 --> 20:44.800
Even if you didn't choose to be,
you were the Great Hero.

20:46.510 --> 20:49.250
After being rescued by the king,

20:49.250 --> 20:52.560
I left on a journey to find out who I was.

20:53.090 --> 20:55.060
People saved by the Great Hero.

20:55.520 --> 20:57.220
Entire towns.

20:57.220 --> 20:58.640
I came across so many.

21:01.930 --> 21:04.840
You should be proud of that.

21:04.840 --> 21:06.060
That's impossible.

21:06.930 --> 21:07.880
I see.

21:08.390 --> 21:09.770
It's fine if you can't.

21:10.240 --> 21:11.200
However...

21:11.840 --> 21:17.730
I take pride in the fact that I was 
created to be an Artificial Great Hero.

21:17.730 --> 21:18.420
What?

21:18.850 --> 21:22.300
I want to become like you.

21:24.470 --> 21:27.430
That's... That's...

21:27.970 --> 21:30.600
No, I...

21:34.160 --> 21:37.940
won't let my past as the 
Great Hero bother me!

21:38.300 --> 21:39.100
Yes.

21:39.740 --> 21:43.360
If that's what you decide, then that's fine.

21:46.060 --> 21:48.610
Your identity as the Great Hero...

21:48.610 --> 21:50.490
is the secret we share.

21:53.910 --> 21:55.750
Yeah, it's a promise.

21:56.480 --> 21:58.370
Just between the two of us.

23:34.510 --> 23:39.980
<b>Next Time</b>

23:35.260 --> 23:39.980
<b>Cu Chulainn</b>
